{"id":"c6902dd0863cb754","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-nno-parameter-iteration.md","title":"Theorem — 带参数的自然数迭代","display":"Theorem — 带参数的自然数迭代","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-nno-parameter-iteration","aliases":["14-thm-nno-parameter-iteration"],"display":"Theorem — 带参数的自然数迭代","depends_on":["[[14-df-natural-numbers-object]]","[[14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products]]","[[14-df-exponentials]]"],"source_location":"VI.1, printed 269; VI Exercise 1(i), printed 343; DjVu 140,177","source_evidence":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-nno-parameter-iteration"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-nno-parameter-iteration</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — 带参数的自然数迭代"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8ee22b56cc1189dc\" href=\"?note=8ee22b56cc1189dc\" title=\"14-df-natural-numbers-object\">14-df-natural-numbers-object</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1044b7940aaa4f1f\" href=\"?note=1044b7940aaa4f1f\" title=\"14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products\">14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4fc4fd1ccffdbab5\" href=\"?note=4fc4fd1ccffdbab5\" title=\"14-df-exponentials\">14-df-exponentials</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"VI.1, printed 269; VI Exercise 1(i), printed 343; DjVu 140,177"},{"key":"source_evidence","html":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定 Grothendieck 宇宙 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span>；以下范畴及 Hom 集在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span> 中处理。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 为初等拓扑斯，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(N,z,s)\">\\((N,z,s)\\)</span> 为自然数对象。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\">\\(X,Y\\)</span> 为对象，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:X\\to Y\">\\(g:X\\to Y\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:Y\\times X\\to Y\">\\(h:Y\\times X\\to Y\\)</span> 为给定箭头。积、配对、积箭头和所选指数使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1044b7940aaa4f1f\" href=\"?note=1044b7940aaa4f1f\" title=\"14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products\">14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4fc4fd1ccffdbab5\" href=\"?note=4fc4fd1ccffdbab5\" title=\"14-df-exponentials\">14-df-exponentials</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_X:N\\times X\\to X\">\\(\\pi_X:N\\times X\\to X\\)</span> 是第二投影，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"!_X:X\\to1\">\\(!_X:X\\to1\\)</span> 为唯一箭头。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists!f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(N\\times X,Y)\\;\\left(f\\circ\\langle z\\circ!_X,\\operatorname{id}_X\\rangle=g\\land f\\circ(s\\times\\operatorname{id}_X)=h\\circ\\langle f,\\pi_X\\rangle\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists!f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(N\\times X,Y)\\;\\left(f\\circ\\langle z\\circ!_X,\\operatorname{id}_X\\rangle=g\\land f\\circ(s\\times\\operatorname{id}_X)=h\\circ\\langle f,\\pi_X\\rangle\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源说明：以下来源定位与历史核对经历为所附原稿的记录；本次核对对象为本对话提供的数学笔记。</p>\n<p>取指数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y^X\">\\(Y^X\\)</span>。箭头 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 经 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\cong1\\times X\">\\(X\\cong1\\times X\\)</span> 转置成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar g:1\\to Y^X\">\\(\\bar g:1\\to Y^X\\)</span>；把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(a,x)\\mapsto h(\\operatorname{ev}(a,x),x)\">\\((a,x)\\mapsto h(\\operatorname{ev}(a,x),x)\\)</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 转置成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H:Y^X\\to Y^X\">\\(H:Y^X\\to Y^X\\)</span>。自然数对象给出唯一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v:N\\to Y^X\">\\(v:N\\to Y^X\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"vz=\\bar g\">\\(vz=\\bar g\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"vs=Hv\">\\(vs=Hv\\)</span>。反转置 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span>；将两式反转置恰为所列初值与步进方程。任意满足两式的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 转置后都满足同一递归方程，故唯一。证明只用指数与 NNO，不要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 有全局点。</p>\n<p>原稿记录曾读取原书 VI 练习 1（印刷 343，DjVu 177）并目视核对原图；原书仅提出练习，以下是独立解答。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-natural-numbers-object","status":"resolved","id":"8ee22b56cc1189dc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-natural-numbers-object]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products","status":"resolved","id":"1044b7940aaa4f1f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-exponentials","status":"resolved","id":"4fc4fd1ccffdbab5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-exponentials]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products","status":"resolved","id":"1044b7940aaa4f1f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为初等拓扑斯，$(N,z,s)$ 为自然数对象。$X,Y$ 为对象，$g:X\\to Y$、$h:Y\\times X\\to Y$ 为给定箭头。积、配对、积箭头和所选指数使用 [[14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products]]、[[14-df-exponentials]]；$\\pi_X:N\\times X\\to X$ 是第二投影，$!_X:X\\to1$ 为唯一箭头。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-exponentials","status":"resolved","id":"4fc4fd1ccffdbab5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为初等拓扑斯，$(N,z,s)$ 为自然数对象。$X,Y$ 为对象，$g:X\\to Y$、$h:Y\\times X\\to Y$ 为给定箭头。积、配对、积箭头和所选指数使用 [[14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products]]、[[14-df-exponentials]]；$\\pi_X:N\\times X\\to X$ 是第二投影，$!_X:X\\to1$ 为唯一箭头。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"(N,z,s)","display":false},{"tex":"X,Y","display":false},{"tex":"g:X\\to Y","display":false},{"tex":"h:Y\\times X\\to Y","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_X:N\\times X\\to X","display":false},{"tex":"!_X:X\\to1","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists!f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(N\\times X,Y)\\;\\left(f\\circ\\langle z\\circ!_X,\\operatorname{id}_X\\rangle=g\\land f\\circ(s\\times\\operatorname{id}_X)=h\\circ\\langle f,\\pi_X\\rangle\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"Y^X","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"X\\cong1\\times X","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar g:1\\to Y^X","display":false},{"tex":"(a,x)\\mapsto h(\\operatorname{ev}(a,x),x)","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"H:Y^X\\to Y^X","display":false},{"tex":"v:N\\to Y^X","display":false},{"tex":"vz=\\bar g","display":false},{"tex":"vs=Hv","display":false},{"tex":"v","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false}],"bytes":2015,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-151","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-nno-parameter-iteration|thm-255 — 带参数的自然数迭代]]"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-112","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-nno-parameter-iteration]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-269","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-nno-parameter-iteration]]"},{"id":"3d748c1ba1b93208","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-191","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-nno-parameter-iteration]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-152","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-nno-parameter-iteration|thm-255 — 带参数的自然数迭代]]"},{"id":"399c5a186b3a5845","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为初等拓扑斯，$(N,z,s)$ 为自然数对象，$X,Y$ 为对象。给定 $g:X\\to Y$ 和 $h:(N\\times Y)\\times X\\to Y$。$\\pi_N:N\\times X\\to N$、$\\pi_X:N\\times X\\to X$ 为投影；配对、积箭头见 [[14-thm-nno-parameter-iteration]] 所引定义。"}],"outgoing":["8ee22b56cc1189dc","1044b7940aaa4f1f","4fc4fd1ccffdbab5"]}